{"kind":"finding","id":"FN-B-truth-phone-native-a-01","date":"2026-11-25","lens":"17","surface":"phone","area":"phone/native","refs":["F-phone-1219","FN-A5-phone-tracker-lib-3-01"],"severity":"S3","title":"The home-screen week widget and the Progress tab give different counts for the same week","what":"The 'This week' widget counts days trained since Monday, while the Progress tab's week card counts workouts. A member with a goal of 3 who trains twice on one day and once on another sees '2 of 3, 1 workout to go' on the home screen and '3 of 3, goal met' in the app.","expected":"The widget, Up next and the Progress tab count the week the same way and agree on whether the goal is met.","evidence":["apps/mobile/src/tracker/phone/widgets.ts:84-111","apps/mobile/src/tracker/phone/widgets.ts:313-318","apps/mobile/src/tracker/engine/progressTop.ts:187","apps/mobile/src/components/analytics/WeekCard.tsx:39-48","apps/mobile/src/tracker/engine/progressTop.ts:251-256"],"proof":"code-read","root_cause_key":"week-goal-counted-two-ways","who":"members with a weekly goal and the week widget","how_often":"any week with two workouts on one day","fix_line":"Pick one way to count the week (days or workouts) and use it in the widget, Up next and Progress","fix_size":"small","needs_him":true,"verified":"pending","status":"open"}
{"kind":"finding","id":"FN-B-truth-phone-native-a-02","date":"2026-11-25","lens":"17","surface":"phone","area":"phone/native","refs":["F-phone-1220"],"severity":"S4","title":"The 'Gym right now' widget says 'Busy' where the Gym tab says 'Busier than usual'","what":"The gym's reading only compares now with the gym's usual crowd. The Gym tab says 'Busier than usual right now', but the home-screen widget shortens it to 'Busy', which reads as a crowded gym even when it is only a bit above a quiet usual.","expected":"The widget uses the same meaning as the Gym tab, for example 'Busier than usual'.","evidence":["apps/mobile/src/tracker/phone/widgets.ts:187-198","apps/mobile/src/shop/gymBusy.ts:74-84"],"proof":"code-read","root_cause_key":"widget-busy-word-drops-usual","who":"members with the gym widget","how_often":"whenever the gym is above its usual","fix_line":"Change the widget word to 'Busier than usual' or similar","fix_size":"small","needs_him":false,"verified":"pending","status":"open"}
